<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 23 August <span class="n">6</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/william-wallace"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/william-wallace.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">William Wallace</span><span class="tp">c. 1270–1305</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/chen-youliang"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Chen Youliang</span><span class="tp">1320–1363</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/gil-alvarez-carrillo-de-albornoz"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/gil-alvarez-carrillo-de-albornoz.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Gil Álvarez Carrillo de Albornoz</span><span class="tp">c. 1310–1367</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/increase-mather"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/increase-mather.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Increase Mather</span><span class="tp">1639–1723</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/august-von-gneisenau"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/august-von-gneisenau.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">August von Gneisenau</span><span class="tp">1760–1831</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/eric-gairy"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/eric-gairy.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Eric Gairy</span><span class="tp">1922–1997</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
